    {
      "id": "architecture.modules",
      "revision": 2,
      "section": "architecture",
      "sources": [
        {
          "detail": "evidence-sha256:248817b1174f6e497c59142efba965fda4c761ad6bf4c198fdf3faf85432b785",
          "kind": "detected",
          "reference": "filesystem:top-level-directories"
        },
        {
          "kind": "user",
          "reference": "user-confirmed"
        }
      ],
      "status": "verified",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-08T01:14:27Z",
      "value": "pkg contains only business-neutral cross-service capabilities and must not import services. Service-private configuration, domain, use cases, repositories, and transports remain under services/<service>. idl is the contract source, kitex_gen and services/collaboration/src/generated are generator-owned, scripts contains repository automation, deploy and docker contain deployment and infrastructure definitions, config contains non-secret configuration structure, docs records verified design, and tools contains supporting executables."
    },
    {
      "id": "architecture.summary",
      "revision": 2,
      "section": "architecture",
      "sources": [
        {
          "detail": "evidence-sha256:6cc08ddcf5525a7adc55f189cd2dadddf88fab06ae4e47bfeb47c2e58a779255",
          "kind": "documented",
          "reference": "README.md#knowledge-core"
        },
        {
          "detail": "evidence-sha256:6cc08ddcf5525a7adc55f189cd2dadddf88fab06ae4e47bfeb47c2e58a779255",
          "kind": "documented",
          "reference": "deploy/overlay/dev/README.md#development-overlay"
        },
        {
          "detail": "evidence-sha256:6cc08ddcf5525a7adc55f189cd2dadddf88fab06ae4e47bfeb47c2e58a779255",
          "kind": "documented",
          "reference": "docs/framework-design.md#knowledge-core"
        },
        {
          "detail": "evidence-sha256:6cc08ddcf5525a7adc55f189cd2dadddf88fab06ae4e47bfeb47c2e58a779255",
          "kind": "documented",
          "reference": "docs/rust-collaboration-design.md#rust-collaboration"
        },
        {
          "kind": "user",
          "reference": "user-confirmed"
        }
      ],
      "status": "verified",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-08T01:14:27Z",
      "value": "Knowledge Core contains four explicitly composed services: Go Gateway, Identity, and Knowledge services plus a Rust Collaboration service. Go assembly flows main/spec -> internal/config -> internal/context -> domain/logic/repository/transport. ServiceContext owns service dependencies, while pkg/app.Runtime is limited to process-level observability, health, metrics, and lifecycle orchestration. Business logic depends on service-local small interfaces; repositories own persistence and storage error mapping; transports validate and adapt protocols without domain rules."
    },
    {
