      "value": "Work directly on the existing dev branch only. Use repository scripts or make generate for generation; use make tidy after Go dependency changes. Run make ci after every change, add make race for Go concurrency or lifecycle changes, and run npm ci followed by npm run ci in services/collaboration/interop when that fixture changes. IDL changes also require go run ./scripts/idlguard compat-git <merge-base> idl."
